      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:52927/openbsd-5-6/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://rodrigolira.eti.br/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/openbsd5.6.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;openbsd5.6&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;200&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;140&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/openbsd-5-6/images/openbsd5.6.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:52927/openbsd-5-6/images/openbsd5.6.png 800w, http://localhost:52927/openbsd-5-6/images/openbsd5.6.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/openbsd-5-6/images/openbsd5.6.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Lançada a versão 5.6 do OpenBSD.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Para maiores detalhes acesse o link: &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.openbsd.org/56.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;http://www.openbsd.org/56.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Para download: &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.openbsd.org/ftp.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;http://www.openbsd.org/ftp.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Segue abaixo um vídeo de instalação da nova versão feito por &lt;a href=&#34;http://br.linkedin.com/in/teebsd&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Antonio Feitosa&lt;/a&gt; do &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/openbsd_br&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;@openbsd_br&lt;/a&gt; .&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
