      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:52927/lancado-the-book-of-pf-3rd-edition/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://rodrigolira.eti.br/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/pf.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;pf&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;200&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;140&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/lancado-the-book-of-pf-3rd-edition/images/pf.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:52927/lancado-the-book-of-pf-3rd-edition/images/pf.png 800w, http://localhost:52927/lancado-the-book-of-pf-3rd-edition/images/pf.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/lancado-the-book-of-pf-3rd-edition/images/pf.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Dica rápida!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Foi lançado o The Book of PF, 3rd Edition, a maior referência quando se fala em firewall na família BSD, e é o firewall nativo do OpenBSD o qual estudo como hobby :)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
